INSERT INTO forum_posts (category_id, title, body, author_name, pinned, published, published_at)
SELECT id, 'Known Issues & Fixes', '## Known Issues & Fixes
Common problems and how to fix them.

**My armour is invisible in Epic Fight battle mode**
This is a known incompatibility between Epic Fight and some modded armour, including Tensura armour. Your armour still protects you; it just isn''t drawn in battle mode. Press **R** to switch to mining mode to see it again.

**My camera glitches in third person**
This happens when two lock-on systems run together: Epic Fight''s lock-on (**G**) and Better Lock On. Use only one. Unbind the one you don''t want in Options → Controls → Key Binds.

**The game crashes or freezes while loading**
Usually not enough memory. Give the pack **6–8 GB** of RAM in your launcher, then restart. Close other heavy programs.

**My FPS is low**
Turn shaders off with **O** (pick "None"), lower Render Distance to 8–12 and Simulation Distance to 6–8 in Video Settings. Sodium''s extra options are under Video Settings too.

**My keys do two things at once**
Follow the [key conflict fixes](/guide#key-conflicts).

**Nobody can hear me in voice chat**
Press **V**, open the settings and pick the right microphone. Make sure you aren''t muted (**M**) and that voice chat isn''t turned off (**N**).

**I found a bug or exploit**
Report it privately in a Discord ticket. Don''t abuse it; using bugs for an advantage is against [rule 1.2](/rules#global-bans).

[Open the full Player Guide](/guide#fixes)', 'OVERTHRONE Staff', 1, 1, strftime('%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%SZ', 'now')
FROM forum_categories
WHERE slug = 'help'
  AND NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM forum_posts WHERE title = 'Known Issues & Fixes');
INSERT INTO forum_posts (category_id, title, body, author_name, pinned, published, published_at)
SELECT id, 'FAQ', '## FAQ
Quick answers.

**Is the server free?**
Yes. You need Minecraft: Java Edition and the OVERTHRONE modpack.

**Can Bedrock or console players join?**
No. Modded servers only work with Java Edition on PC.

**Can I add my own mods?**
Only client-side mods that don''t give an advantage, such as minimaps you already have, shaders or performance mods. X-ray, freecam and other cheat mods get you banned. If you''re not sure, ask in a Discord ticket first.

**What version is it?**
Minecraft 1.21.1 with NeoForge. Use the modpack so every mod version matches the server.

**Where do I get help?**
Open a ticket in the Discord, or check the [forums](/forums).

[Open the full Player Guide](/guide#faq)', 'OVERTHRONE Staff', 1, 1, strftime('%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%SZ', 'now')
FROM forum_categories
WHERE slug = 'help'
  AND NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM forum_posts WHERE title = 'FAQ');
INSERT INTO forum_posts (category_id, title, body, author_name, pinned, published, published_at)
SELECT id, 'Coins, the Arcade & Trading', '## Coins & the Arcade
The server runs on Lightman''s Currency coins: real items you carry, spend and trade.

**Coins, lowest to highest:** Copper → Iron → Gold → Emerald → Diamond → Netherite

10 of each coin is worth 1 of the next. So 1 Netherite coin = 100,000 Copper.

- **Earn** (In game only): Quest rewards (especially the Ledger), voting, trading with players and selling what you gather.
- **Spend** (/warp arcade): The Arcade & Trade Hall in the RPG world: gacha machines for weapons, armour, enchants, runes and misc items, vending machines, and the exchange counter.
- **Share** (Community Chest): Leave spare gear for new players, or grab something to get started. Take what you need, not everything.

**Everything in the Arcade is grindable for free.** Coins come from playing. You can''t buy them with real money, and selling coins or items for real money breaks [rule 1.5](/rules#global-bans).

Vote for the server every day on the [Vote page](/vote) for extra rewards.

[Open the full Player Guide](/guide#economy)', 'OVERTHRONE Staff', 1, 1, strftime('%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%SZ', 'now')
FROM forum_categories
WHERE slug = 'economy'
  AND NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM forum_posts WHERE title = 'Coins, the Arcade & Trading');
INSERT INTO forum_posts (category_id, title, body, author_name, pinned, published, published_at)
SELECT id, 'How Quests Work', '## Quests
There are over 1,100 quests in the quest book. Open it by talking to Questmaster Orin in the RPG world, or with the quest book button in your inventory.

- **The Quest Board** (100 quests): The Hunter''s path from E-Rank to S-Rank. Every 10th quest is a Rank Trial. Rewards are balance, XP and gear that gets better at each rank.
- **The Hunter''s Ledger** (1,012 quests): Ten Ledgers of coin quests covering farming, exploring, crafting, fishing, the Nether, magic, caves, bounties, the End and legendary feats. Finishing all of them pays about 1,500 Netherite coins.

**Quest Board rank · Quests · Chapter**
- **E-Rank**: 1–20 · The Awakening
- **D-Rank**: 21–40 · The Wilds
- **C-Rank**: 41–60 · Into the Depths
- **B-Rank**: 61–80 · The Hunt Beyond
- **S-Rank**: 81–100 · Overthrow

**Ledger · Theme**
- **I. Homestead**: Farming, food and animals
- **II. Wanderlust**: Exploring biomes and structures
- **III. Artisan''s Guild**: Crafting and building
- **IV. Tides & Tails**: Fishing and the ocean
- **V. Into the Nether**: The Nether and its fortresses
- **VI. Arcane Arts**: Enchanting, brewing and magic
- **VII. The Deep Below**: Caves, mining and the deep dark
- **VIII. Bounty Board**: Hunting mobs
- **IX. The Far End**: The End
- **X. Legends of the Realm**: The hardest feats and bosses

- Each Ledger unlocks once you''ve finished entry 50 of the one before it.
- Every 10th Ledger entry and each finale also gives **enchanted gear**. The strongest modded weapons, armour and spellbooks come from the late Ledgers.
- Hand-in quests take the items from your inventory, so don''t hand in anything you want to keep.

[Open the full Player Guide](/guide#quests)', 'OVERTHRONE Staff', 1, 1, strftime('%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%SZ', 'now')
FROM forum_categories
WHERE slug = 'quests'
  AND NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM forum_posts WHERE title = 'How Quests Work');
INSERT INTO forum_posts (category_id, title, body, author_name, pinned, published, published_at)
SELECT id, 'Bosses & Dungeons Guide', '## Bosses & Dungeons
The pack adds a lot of things that want you dead. Gear up, bring food, and don''t fight the big ones alone.

- **L_Ender''s Cataclysm** (Bosses): Huge boss fights in their own structures: Ignis, the Netherite Monstrosity, the Ender Guardian, the Leviathan, the Harbinger, the Ancient Remnant, Maledictus and Scylla.
- **Mowzie''s Mobs** (Bosses): The Ferrous Wroughtnaut, Frostmaw, Umvuthi and the Naga, each with its own attack pattern to learn.
- **The Aether** (Sky dimension): A floating dimension with dungeons and bosses: the Slider, the Valkyrie Queen and the Sun Spirit.
- **Deeper and Darker** (The Otherside): A dimension reached from Ancient Cities in the deep dark, home to the Stalker. Sneak, and be quiet.
- **Born in Chaos** (Night mobs): Nightmarish monsters that make the night much more dangerous. Don''t wander far from a light source.
- **Dungeons & loot** (Explore): YUNG''s Better Dungeons, Dungeons and Taverns and Explorify add structures everywhere. Lootr gives every player their own loot from the same chest.

**Apotheosis** can make any mob an elite with extra powers, and gives gear random affixes and gem sockets. If a mob has a name and glows, be careful.

[Open the full Player Guide](/guide#bosses)', 'OVERTHRONE Staff', 1, 1, strftime('%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%SZ', 'now')
FROM forum_categories
WHERE slug = 'bosses'
  AND NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM forum_posts WHERE title = 'Bosses & Dungeons Guide');
INSERT INTO forum_posts (category_id, title, body, author_name, pinned, published, published_at)
SELECT id, 'Worlds & Warps', '## Worlds & Warps
Use warps to get around fast. The warp boards in the hub list every destination.

- **/warp hub**: OVERTHRONE hub
- **/warp survival**: Survival world
- **/warp realms**: Realm portals
- **/warp market**: Market
- **/warp tavern**: Tavern
- **/warp classes**: Classes
- **/warp hunters**: Hunters
- **/warp crates**: Crates
- **/warp afk**: AFK area
- **/rpg**: RPG world
- **/warp arcade**: Arcade & Trade Hall
- **/warp arcanum**: The Arcanum: enchanting & runes

- **The RPG world is protected.** You can''t break or place blocks, and buckets, flint and steel, fire charges and explosions are blocked. It''s a city to visit, not to build in.
- **Back to the hub:** walk through the portal in the RPG world to return to the hub.
- **Travel further:** activate Waystones as you find them to teleport between them. Use Nature''s Compass to find a biome.
- **Maps:** Xaero''s Minimap and World Map (**M**) show where you are and your waypoints.

